              "datePublished": "2026-07-08",
              "reviewBody": "I have made this numerous times! Always changing it up with my veggies and fruit! I have have even used peaches once! I use a chicken sausage that is flavored like Italian flavor or garlic and herb. Aidells Sausage or The Sausage Project work good! You don't have to use the potatoes but it is good with them! I use white cut up potato chunks!  I also switched up the seasonings too! My favorite is a roasted garlic herb seasoning by McCormick!",
